{"id":"486f013af515d400","group":"90","path":"90/90-ex-quine-construction.md","title":"Quine Construction Method","display":"ex-quine-construction — Quine Construction Method","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-ex-quine-construction","aliases":["90-ex-quine-construction"],"display":"ex-quine-construction — Quine Construction Method","depends_on":["[[90-df-quine-construction]]","[[90-df-recursion-theorem]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]","[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-ex-quine-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-ex-quine-construction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-quine-construction — Quine Construction Method"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e426ba53e1b66a0\" href=\"?note=3e426ba53e1b66a0\" title=\"90-df-quine-construction\">90-df-quine-construction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"40d9084cba778b26\" href=\"?note=40d9084cba778b26\" title=\"90-df-recursion-theorem\">90-df-recursion-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1802adc1900d4b34\" href=\"?note=1802adc1900d4b34\" title=\"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">90-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定编号族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\\)</span> 及部分函数等号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>要求 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1802adc1900d4b34\" href=\"?note=1802adc1900d4b34\" title=\"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">90-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\)</span>；本书的具体编号满足该条件，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (acceptable numbering of partial computable functions)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(c\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall e,x\\;\\varphi_{c(e)}(x)=e\">\\(\\forall e,x\\;\\varphi_{c(e)}(x)=e\\)</span> (constant-program compiler)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Quine}(e)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi_e(0)\\downarrow=e\">\\(\\mathrm{Quine}(e)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi_e(0)\\downarrow=e\\)</span> (index-quine predicate)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}quine\\text{-}construction}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\varphi_e\\simeq\\varphi_{c(e)}\n\\land\\mathrm{Quine}(e)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}quine\\text{-}construction}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\varphi_e\\simeq\\varphi_{c(e)}\n\\land\\mathrm{Quine}(e)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"3e426ba53e1b66a0\" href=\"?note=3e426ba53e1b66a0\" title=\"90-df-quine-construction\">90-df-quine-construction</a> 中的常量程序编译器及固定点构造，立即得到断言。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对编译器索引变换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 应用 Kleene 递归定理取得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>；于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(0)=\\varphi_{c(e)}(0)=e\">\\(\\varphi_e(0)=\\varphi_{c(e)}(0)=e\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>这是输出自身索引的抽象 quine；具体源码 quine 还需有效的源码—索引编译约定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-quine-construction","status":"resolved","id":"3e426ba53e1b66a0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-quine-construction]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursion-theorem","status":"resolved","id